    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "bio and request structures",
      "source_hash": 3996961498819139932,
      "context_hash": 7925724518023756772,
      "translation": "bio 및 request 구조체",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:49:39.719178Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The objects that describe I/O operations in the block layer",
      "source_hash": 2915580945410312509,
      "context_hash": 13353088649606134854,
      "translation": "블록 계층에서 I/O 작업을 기술하는 객체",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "block layer": "블록 계층"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:49:39.719178Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "struct bio: the submission unit",
      "source_hash": 5939082449078806426,
      "context_hash": 4457307248721498043,
      "translation": "struct bio: 제출 단위",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:49:39.719179Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "A `bio` (Block I/O) is the fundamental I/O descriptor.",
      "source_hash": 16176655678511201402,
      "context_hash": 5116557365386602133,
      "translation": "`bio`(Block I/O)는 기본적인 I/O 디스크립터입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "descriptor": "디스크립터"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:49:39.719179Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "It describes a scatter-gather I/O operation: one or more physical memory segments mapped to contiguous sectors on a block device.",
      "source_hash": 3472999845349764504,
      "context_hash": 5502155980753478563,
      "translation": "이는 scatter-gather I/O 작업, 즉 블록 디바이스의 연속된 섹터에 매핑된 하나 이상의 물리 메모리 세그먼트를 기술합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "block device": "블록 디바이스",
        "physical memory": "물리 메모리",
        "scatter-gather": "scatter-gather"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:49:39.719179Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "struct bio_vec: one scatter-gather segment",
      "source_hash": 8787945763068968125,
      "context_hash": 82955552778815547,
      "translation": "struct bio_vec: 하나의 scatter-gather 세그먼트",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "scatter-gather": "scatter-gather"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:49:39.719180Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Each `bio_vec` describes a contiguous chunk of memory (one page or less).",
      "source_hash": 12841224973612904877,
      "context_hash": 18261508035088268190,
      "translation": "각 `bio_vec`는 연속된 메모리 덩어리(한 페이지 이하)를 기술합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "memory": "메모리"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:49:39.719180Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:1",
      "source": "A bio with multiple `bio_vec`s is a scatter-gather operation:",
      "source_hash": 5686418697210518021,
      "context_hash": 17694547865396200411,
      "translation": "여러 개의 `bio_vec`를 가진 bio는 scatter-gather 작업입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "scatter-gather": "scatter-gather"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:49:39.719180Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "bio_vec iteration",
      "source_hash": 2776507815336808283,
      "context_hash": 14617797798365788065,
      "translation": "bio_vec 순회",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:49:39.719180Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "bio operations (bi_opf)",
      "source_hash": 16264344487125508677,
      "context_hash": 9640517889835565406,
      "translation": "bio 연산(bi_opf)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:49:39.719180Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Allocating and submitting a bio",
      "source_hash": 17063577319078003296,
      "context_hash": 18369421809926807988,
      "translation": "bio 할당 및 제출",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:49:39.719180Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "struct request: the scheduled unit",
      "source_hash": 9630742814988318657,
      "context_hash": 18219684147866163534,
      "translation": "struct request: 스케줄링 단위",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:49:39.719180Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "While `bio` is the submission unit from the filesystem, `struct request` is what the I/O scheduler works with.",
      "source_hash": 2604958512396500035,
      "context_hash": 10847953333287141492,
      "translation": "`bio`가 파일시스템에서 오는 제출 단위라면, `struct request`는 I/O 스케줄러가 다루는 단위입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "scheduler": "스케줄러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:49:39.719180Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Multiple bios can be **merged** into a single request if they are adjacent on disk:",
      "source_hash": 8310488370165937487,
      "context_hash": 2222080931052046241,
      "translation": "여러 bio가 디스크상에서 인접해 있으면 하나의 request로 **병합**될 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:49:39.719180Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Bio merging",
      "source_hash": 15382555997230602100,
      "context_hash": 4657679895934330328,
      "translation": "bio 병합",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:49:39.719180Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "The I/O scheduler tries to merge adjacent bios into one request before dispatch:",
      "source_hash": 11020753036479484176,
      "context_hash": 12533884976014602819,
      "translation": "I/O 스케줄러는 디스패치 전에 인접한 bio들을 하나의 request로 병합하려고 시도합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "scheduler": "스케줄러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:49:39.719180Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Merging is constrained by hardware limits:",
      "source_hash": 6079053557215656255,
      "context_hash": 13973362603831633926,
      "translation": "병합은 하드웨어 제한의 제약을 받습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "hardware": "하드웨어"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:49:39.719181Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "`queue->limits.max_sectors` — maximum request size",
      "source_hash": 12985109879008147983,
      "context_hash": 4422031243547852044,
      "translation": "`queue->limits.max_sectors` — 최대 request 크기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:49:39.719181Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "`queue->limits.max_segments` — maximum scatter-gather segments",
      "source_hash": 16395959725093691022,
      "context_hash": 316300583746027764,
      "translation": "`queue->limits.max_segments` — 최대 scatter-gather 세그먼트 수",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "scatter-gather": "scatter-gather"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:49:39.719181Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "`queue->limits.max_segment_size` — maximum bytes per segment",
      "source_hash": 10734333696028595121,
      "context_hash": 45930920979153006,
      "translation": "`queue->limits.max_segment_size` — 세그먼트당 최대 바이트 수",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "bytes": "바이트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:49:39.719181Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "bio splitting",
      "source_hash": 16699142185598278700,
      "context_hash": 1417256254157274317,
      "translation": "bio 분할",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:49:39.719181Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "When a bio exceeds hardware limits, the block layer splits it:",
      "source_hash": 15597318729197173641,
      "context_hash": 3953989595601726570,
      "translation": "bio가 하드웨어 제한을 초과하면 블록 계층이 이를 분할합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "block layer": "블록 계층",
        "hardware": "하드웨어"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:49:39.719181Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Splitting is transparent to the filesystem — the completion callback fires only when all sub-bios complete.",
      "source_hash": 6246779640648563113,
      "context_hash": 17836494020892846636,
      "translation": "분할은 파일시스템에 투명하게 이루어집니다 — 완료 콜백은 모든 하위 bio가 완료되었을 때에만 호출됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "callback": "콜백"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:49:39.719181Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
